ipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1004605","helmet":"WP1024505"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[78,72,73,71,58,75],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"99","reputation":"1050","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1004605","helmet":"WP1024505"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[78,72,73,71,58,75],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"950","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1004605","helmet":"WP1024505"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[78,72,73,71,58,75],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"950","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1004605","helmet":"WP1024505"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"吴国武将，早年因为人宽善而家乡闻名。入吴仕官后，因平定三郡山越贼有功而官至越骑校尉。蜀国灭亡后官至武陵太守，受封平魏将军，并平定了周遭蛮夷部落动乱，受封都乡侯，官至濡须督。","tc":"吳國武將，早年因為人寬善而家鄉聞名。入吳仕官后，因平定三郡山越賊有功而官至越騎校尉。蜀國滅亡后官至武陵太守，受封平魏將軍，并平定了周遭蠻夷部落動亂，受封都鄉侯，官至濡須督。","en":"Officer of Wu who earned a reputation in his hometown from an early age for his kind and generous character. After entering Wu's service, he was promoted to Commandant of the Cavalry Escort for his merit in pacifying Shanyue bandits in three commanderies. After Shu fell, he rose to Governor of Wuling and was titled General Who Pacifies Wei, successfully suppressing unrest among the surrounding barbarian tribes. He was enfeoffed as Marquis of Duxiang and eventually rose to Commander of Ruxu.","jp":"呉の武将。若くして寛厚な人柄により郷里で名を知られた。呉に仕官した後は、三郡の山越の賊を平定した功績により越騎校尉に至る。蜀の滅亡後は武陵太守に任じられ、平魏将軍の号を授けられた。さらに周辺の蛮夷の部族による動乱を平定したことで都郷侯に封ぜられ、濡須督に至った。","kr":"오나라의 무장. 젊은 시절 인품이 너그럽고 후하여 고향에 명성이 자자했다. 오나라에 출사하여 사관한 뒤, 삼군의 산월 도적을 평정한 공으로 월기교위에 올랐다. 촉나라가 멸망한 후에는 무릉태수를 지내며 평위장군에 배령되었고, 주변 만이 부족의 반란을 평정하여 도향후에 봉해졌으며 유수독에 이르렀다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10476","remark":"","surname":"钟","surnameTc":"鐘","surnameEn":"Zhong","surnameJp":"鍾","surnameKr":"종","surnameOther":"","name":"离牧","nameTc":"離牧","nameEn":"Limu","nameJp":"離牧","nameKr":"이목","nameOther":"","word":"子干","wordTc":"子干","wordEn":"Zigan","wordJp":"子幹","wordKr":"자간","wordOther":"","icon":"钟离牧","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"233","city":"CS1053","gender":"0","rule":"78","force":"72","wise":"73","politics":"71","charm":"58","will":"75","ruleTalent":"10","forceTalent":"8","wiseTalent":"8","politicsTalent":"8","charmTalent":"5","willTalent":"9","weaponMaster":"72/18/78/18/18/70/23/18","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"1008802;1007202","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"1020305","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"6000","battleSoulPoint":"5100","debateSoulPoint":"5300","strategy":"","strategy2":"","professions":"3/0/0/2/3/3/3/0/2/2/0/0/1/1/3/2/2/0/1/1/0/1/2/1","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"5","compatible":"80","loyalty":"0","reputation":"950","evaluate":"0","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"214","show":"233","death":"269","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"0","type":"1","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"0","weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1004605","helmet":"WP1024505","treasure":"","horse":"","shield":"","character":"0/1;1/1;12/1;21/1;23/1;29/1;57/1;45/0","father":"","mother":"","children":"","family":"","modInfo":"","brother":"","couple":"","otherRelationship":"","belief":"0","isVIP":"0","startVIPYear":"0",